Task 5.2 – Change the Requirement (2 Marks)
New requirements:
1. Convert when the user clicks the Convert button.
2. Convert when the user presses Enter in the amount field.
3. Display the conversion result in a dialog box.
The conversion logic should be kept inside the convert() method. Only the event registration needs to change in each implementation.
Style	Modification required
(a) Frame implements ActionListener	Register this with both components and call convert() in actionPerformed().
(b) Named inner class	Create one handler object and register it with both components.
(c) Anonymous inner class	Store the anonymous listener in a variable and register it with both components.
(d) Lambda expression	Store one lambda listener and register it with both components.

